+
+| Layer | Technologies |
+|---|---|
+| **Frontend** | Next.js 16 (App Router), React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS 4, Motion |
+| **3D visualization** | three.js, React Three Fiber, drei (WebGL) |
+| **Charts** | Plotly.js |
